==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Darkmadillo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Grand Emperor Warumongar]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Darkmadillo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Countess Koryessa]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Send out two [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cats]], who will take care of the Metal Doges and Darkmadillos with the help of [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]]. Upgrade your Wallet to level 5 during this process. When the Crazed Giraffe Cats instigate the boss wave, pivot to tanking with [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]] instead of Eraser Cats. As long as you keep sending out Crazed Giraffes to kill the occasional Metal Doge, [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Prime]] DX will have no trouble eviscerating the Dark enemies. Don't forget to bring the other [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] for their [[Cat Combo]]s too.

